# Prettier is the frontend's formatter, not a prose tool. Markdown here is
# documentation whose line breaks are deliberate — CLAUDE.md, the docs/, and the
# spec deltas all read as hand-wrapped paragraphs — and reflowing them would bury
# real edits in whitespace. `openspec/` and `.claude/` are further off-limits:
# their contents are generated or vendored by the OpenSpec CLI, so a local
# reformat is reverted the next time the tool writes them.
*.md
openspec
.claude

# docker-compose.yml is the frozen user-facing surface. Its comments and
# alignment are documentation that users read and copy; reformatting it would
# churn a file every install has a copy of. See CLAUDE.md.
docker-compose.yml

